<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Mar 10.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Mar 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Apr/Jun 118.25</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Liverpool Mar 100.00 Apr 103.00 Apr/Jun 104.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Mar 98.00 Apr/Jun 101.00 Jul 103.50</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 98.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Apr/Jun 99.50</p>
<p>Southampton Mar 97.00</p>
</text>
